        "sid": "1CO 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I speak with the tongues of men and of angels, but have not love, I am become sounding brass, or a clanging cymbal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if I have ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " prophecy, and know all mysteries and all knowledge; and if I have all faith, so as to remove mountains, but have not love, I am nothing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if I bestow all my goods to feed ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and if I give my body to be burned, but have not love, it profiteth me nothing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Love suffereth long, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is kind; love envieth not; love vaunteth not itself, is not puffed up, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "doth not behave itself unseemly, seeketh not its own, is not provoked, taketh not account of evil; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rejoiceth not in unrighteousness, but rejoiceth with the truth; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "beareth all things, believeth all things, hopeth all things, endureth all things. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Love never faileth: but whether ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " prophecies, they shall be done away; whether ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " tongues, they shall cease; whether ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " knowledge, it shall be done away. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For we know in part, and we prophesy in part; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but when that which is perfect is come, that which is in part shall be done away. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I was a child, I spake as a child, I felt as a child, I thought as a child: now that I am become a man, I have put away childish things. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For now we see in a mirror, darkly; but then face to face: now I know in part; but then shall I know fully even as also I was fully known. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now abideth faith, hope, love, these three; and the greatest of these is love.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
